    "northStar": "Warm Signal",
    "overview": "Warm Signal is the incumbent identity named in the stylesheet: warm dark surfaces, amber and coral accents, Fraunces branding, and DM Sans interface text. This document records the built call surfaces and their device selector; it does not propose a replacement identity.",
